bramble-player (1.1.0~beta1) stable; urgency=low

  * CD Audio playback support via libcdio
  * Integrated file browser with directory navigation
  * Playlist view for tracks and folder contents
  * Improved track selection and seeking
  * Fixed CDROM detection on Linux

 -- Bramble <contact@bramble.player>  Tue, 28 Apr 2026 04:00:00 +0000

bramble-player (1.0.0) stable; urgency=low

  * Initial release
  * Multi-format audio playback (WAV, MP3, FLAC, OGG, MOD, XM, S3M, IT)
  * 18-band equalizer
  * Crystallizer effect
  * Audio visualizer
  * Skin system with 9 themes
  * Album art detection

 -- Bramble <contact@bramble.player>  Mon, 27 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000
